# Review of the closure glue (hunt HSTR2-01): each mode at 1000 and 4000
# (RtIOFinishAlloc.lean). Natively a `putStr` to a handle makes 1
# allocation (its result) and a `getLine` 3; lean2rr's glue built two
# closures at every call (3 and 6 allocations).
put 1000 | put 4000 | 1 200
line 1000 | line 4000 | 1 200
out 1000 | out 4000 | 1 200
